WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.888
Lab 1 runs on a laptop, with the fixture's
date fixed at the end of October.

2
00:00:04.888 --> 00:00:09.083
First you run the tests on Learn's
sample as published, and read the one

3
00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:13.351
where the fake Graph refuses it,
because its state is just display text.

4
00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:15.500
Then list what each task needs.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.050
Then run the pre-merge check
on the repository's own files,

6
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.525
which passes cleanly; a finding
would fail the pipeline.

7
00:00:22.525 --> 00:00:26.398
And then the instructive step: run
the same check on Learn's sample,

8
00:00:26.398 --> 00:00:31.340
and it reports five findings, one for each
of the dangers we walked through earlier.
